# models.manifest — the model files the installers download into ComfyUI's model dirs.
#
# ONE READABLE PLACE for every URL. Both install-linux.sh and install-windows.ps1 read this
# file so the source list lives in exactly one spot. Non-technical users never touch it.
#
# Format (pipe-delimited, one file per line; blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored):
#
#   <subdir>|<dest-filename>|<primary-url>|<fallback-url>|<min-megabytes>
#
#   subdir         where under ComfyUI models/ the file goes: checkpoints | vae | loras
#   dest-filename  the EXACT filename the service references (src/style-loras.ts, workflows/*.json).
#                  The file is always SAVED under this name regardless of the source's own filename.
#   primary-url    tried first. Per the spec this is the CivitAI "source" where a direct,
#                  version-pinned download URL is known; otherwise an ungated Hugging Face mirror.
#   fallback-url   tried if primary is missing/gated/returns a non-safetensors (e.g. a login page).
#                  Use "-" when there is no second source.
#   min-megabytes  the download is REJECTED (and the fallback tried) if the saved file is smaller
#                  than this. Catches HTML/JSON error pages, which are a few KB, not a real model.
#
# Download+verify contract (see download_verify in the installers): skip if the dest file already
# exists and passes verification -> try primary -> verify (real .safetensors: size >= min AND a
# valid safetensors header) -> on failure try fallback -> verify -> on TOTAL failure WARN and
# CONTINUE (that style degrades to prompt-only) rather than failing the whole install.
#
# CivitAI note: civitai.com/api/download/models/<versionId> is the original source but is often
# login-gated; when it is, verification fails and the ungated HF mirror (fallback) is used. That is
# exactly the gating fall-through the spec calls for.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SDXL base + refiner + VAE — canonical, ungated Stability AI repos on Hugging Face.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
checkpoints|sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors|https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0/resolve/main/sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors|-|6000
checkpoints|sd_xl_refiner_1.0.safetensors|https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-refiner-1.0/resolve/main/sd_xl_refiner_1.0.safetensors|-|5000
vae|sdxl_vae.safetensors|https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/sdxl-vae/resolve/main/sdxl_vae.safetensors|-|250
